6c/6c0b061e315f7470aa16c034b92592306ca2f56885af03e3e5d6646619c8f02f.png)\n\nIn this case, we have the point $(12,20).$ So, it takes $12$ minutes for both planes to get to the same altitude (of $20,000\\,\\text{ft}$)."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186495144 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186138429 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "4154d81b-c94a-57f7-80fa-0daa341505e6" :knowledge-point/title "Word Problems"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "bb2a30ae-1ed6-57e5-9b9b-bfdb69e70b5d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494756}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "bb2a30ae-1ed6-57e5-9b9b-bfdb69e70b5d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494756} :answer-field/id #uuid "8ef33cc4-fb24-544f-9ed0-f50976bb0e51" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494983}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "ca8cc474-a6fd-5f11-ade6-2ba10c4d804f" :question/math-academy-id "q-237989" :question/problem "![](images/45/4534ed02abf6740df78c3285292e7235391bc76352e16cfdcd2a149dfc7046c4.png)\n\nWater is being pumped from tank $A$ to tank $B.$ The graph above shows the amount of water (in liters) in each tank as a function of time (in minutes). At what time do tanks $A$ and $B$ contain the same amount of water?\n\nThe tanks contain the same amount of water after{{field-1}}minutes." :question/worked-solution "The tanks contain the same amount when the two graphs intersect.\n\n![](images/23/23efe932ef71f93f3a455a93bda45ded7e44b059853308f6d760a4df4bc7d349.png)\n\nIn this case, we have the point $(4,15).$ So, the tanks contain the same amount ($15\\,\\text{L}$) of water after $t=4$ minutes."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186495121 :knowl